help/[PowerTypes]/compute (hdcert X2) A P x.

help/[PowerTypes]/compute (bccert X3) A P x :- bc/pos X3 , X2 is X3 - 1.

/* generated from [PowerTypes]/expand : {A,S:tm (simpfun A bool)}ded (equal (simpfun A bool) S (simplambda A bool [x]simpapply A bool S x)) */

ded X1 (equal (simpfun A bool) S (simplambda A bool (x \ simpapply A bool S x))) :- help/[PowerTypes]/expand X1 A S.

help/[PowerTypes]/expand (prodcert X2/1 X2/2) A S :- help/[PowerTypes]/expand X2/1 A S , help/[PowerTypes]/expand X2/2 A S.

help/[PowerTypes]/expand (idcert X3) A S :- X3 > 0 , X2 is X3 - 1.

help/[PowerTypes]/expand (ptcert ([PowerTypes]/expand A S)) A S.

